(7321410, 1142624, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful variety of oranges, gold through red, warm and cozy despite their setting.  And something magical happens.... their wigs of snow endow them with personalities and they become a huddled crowd, perhaps watching the passersby.  Personal favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful variety of oranges, gold through red, warm and cozy despite their setting.  And something magical happens.... their wigs of snow endow them with personalities and they become a huddled crowd, perhaps watching the passersby.  Personal favorite in this challenge.', '2015-02-27 09:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321416, 1142479, 173844, '<td valign="top">Striking yet subtle, an almost poetic palette.  The pose and depth of field are wonderful, fading into glorious bokeh.  A tour de force.</td>', 'Striking yet subtle, an almost poetic palette.  The pose and depth of field are wonderful, fading into glorious bokeh.  A tour de force.', '2015-02-27 09:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321424, 1142659, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome scene in which the wintry mountains are passionately embraced by a gorgeous sunset.  It''s absorbing to see the oranges transform through red into purple.  I like how the image is given space on the right from which the brilliance emerges.</td>', 'Handsome scene in which the wintry mountains are passionately embraced by a gorgeous sunset.  It''s absorbing to see the oranges transform through red into purple.  I like how the image is given space on the right from which the brilliance emerges.', '2015-02-27 09:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321427, 1142230, 173844, '<td valign="top">Amazing, sinuous cityscape flooded by dark sunshine.  I love the breadth of this.<br/>A subjective thought --  I''d be curious to see it as a panorama consisting only of the top half (and without the column at the far left), without the tall foreground buildings and what looks like industrial parks.  Then the bridge, river and city beyond would seem to disappear like a wafer consumed by sunlight.</td>', 'Amazing, sinuous cityscape flooded by dark sunshine.  I love the breadth of this.A subjective thought --  I''d be curious to see it as a panorama consisting only of the top half (and without the column at the far left), without the tall foreground buildings and what looks like industrial parks.  Then the bridge, river and city beyond would seem to disappear like a wafer consumed by sunlight.', '2015-02-27 10:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321428, 1142602, 173844, '<td valign="top">The modest orange here is beautifully set off by the expanses of blue.  I also like the composition which finds so much of interest in the deep, flat foreground and midground.  Subtly stunning.</td>', 'The modest orange here is beautifully set off by the expanses of blue.  I also like the composition which finds so much of interest in the deep, flat foreground and midground.  Subtly stunning.', '2015-02-27 10:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321430, 1142679, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image, modest, quiet and finely composed.  A peaceful, eternal moment.  The orange light on the door is so situated that it could be the sun on the horizon.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image, modest, quiet and finely composed.  A peaceful, eternal moment.  The orange light on the door is so situated that it could be the sun on the horizon.', '2015-02-27 10:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321433, 1142579, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  It''s casual, cheery and surprisingly interesting, full of lines, textures and glowing light, the latter set off by the blue glass of the building''s left face.</td>', 'I like this photo.  It''s casual, cheery and surprisingly interesting, full of lines, textures and glowing light, the latter set off by the blue glass of the building''s left face.', '2015-02-27 10:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321437, 1142484, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific image.  I very much like the title.  An alternative could be "whee!".  There''s a great sense of fun and action here.  It''s like a kid''s eye view, standing up in a grocery cart while being pushed at a clip by an older sister or brother towards orange exclamation marks.</td>', 'Terrific image.  I very much like the title.  An alternative could be "whee!".  There''s a great sense of fun and action here.  It''s like a kid''s eye view, standing up in a grocery cart while being pushed at a clip by an older sister or brother towards orange exclamation marks.', '2015-02-27 10:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321441, 1142581, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome scene.  Beautiful, soft light.  The way the foreground trees are lopped off, likening them to columns, adds a sense of majesty and intimacy.  And the slope is anchored by the horizontal orange-red band on the tree (trees?).  A creative way to feature the color by adding it as an understatement, like a touch of lipstick.</td>', 'Handsome scene.  Beautiful, soft light.  The way the foreground trees are lopped off, likening them to columns, adds a sense of majesty and intimacy.  And the slope is anchored by the horizontal orange-red band on the tree (trees?).  A creative way to feature the color by adding it as an understatement, like a touch of lipstick.', '2015-02-27 10:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321445, 1142680, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous dark image with a semi-colon of brilliance.  The colors are nicely modulated.  The sky looks like marble and there is actually detail in the foreground darkness.  The trees look good on the horizon.  My only quibble is that the yellow squiggle above the sun, probably unavoidable, is distracting.</td>', 'Gorgeous dark image with a semi-colon of brilliance.  The colors are nicely modulated.  The sky looks like marble and there is actually detail in the foreground darkness.  The trees look good on the horizon.  My only quibble is that the yellow squiggle above the sun, probably unavoidable, is distracting.', '2015-02-27 11:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321456, 1142470, 173844, '<td valign="top">A modest yet eloquent portrait.  The orange is straightforward in his shirt and more subtly echoed in the background bokeh.  And it''s set off by the complimentary blues of his eyes and the patch of sky.</td>', 'A modest yet eloquent portrait.  The orange is straightforward in his shirt and more subtly echoed in the background bokeh.  And it''s set off by the complimentary blues of his eyes and the patch of sky.', '2015-02-27 11:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321459, 1142648, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely study of this most appropriately orange Chinese lantern.  The detail revealed is fascinating and, coyly, somewhat limited by the depth of field.  The lighting is admirable, drawing out its translucence.</td>', 'Lovely study of this most appropriately orange Chinese lantern.  The detail revealed is fascinating and, coyly, somewhat limited by the depth of field.  The lighting is admirable, drawing out its translucence.', '2015-02-27 11:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321465, 1142555, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup detail of the blue end of a boat and orange ball (float?) hanging over its side by a rope loop.  Lots of texture and pleasing shapes.  The modest background and sky are satisfying.  The additional orange balls on the beach are fine echoes of the main one.</td>', 'Nice closeup detail of the blue end of a boat and orange ball (float?) hanging over its side by a rope loop.  Lots of texture and pleasing shapes.  The modest background and sky are satisfying.  The additional orange balls on the beach are fine echoes of the main one.', '2015-02-27 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321472, 1142657, 173844, '<td valign="top">A brash, intricate melody of copper, almost abstract in its shapes and tones.  A fascinating world unto itself.</td>', 'A brash, intricate melody of copper, almost abstract in its shapes and tones.  A fascinating world unto itself.', '2015-02-27 11:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321473, 1142389, 173844, '<td valign="top">The precise moment of illumination, nicely caught.  Now that''s a frame!  Lovely scene.</td>', 'The precise moment of illumination, nicely caught.  Now that''s a frame!  Lovely scene.', '2015-02-27 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321475, 1142362, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene with muted oranges and great charm, and nicely lit.  Without some obvious anachronisms, this could be a glimpse into a romantic past.  As it is, it''s very well done.</td>', 'Lovely scene with muted oranges and great charm, and nicely lit.  Without some obvious anachronisms, this could be a glimpse into a romantic past.  As it is, it''s very well done.', '2015-02-27 11:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321476, 1142669, 173844, '<td valign="top">While I can''t figure out if these are waves or sand dunes or something else, I do like it very much.  The colors and textures are remarkable, the reference to the American flag is apt.  Quite winning.</td>', 'While I can''t figure out if these are waves or sand dunes or something else, I do like it very much.  The colors and textures are remarkable, the reference to the American flag is apt.  Quite winning.', '2015-02-27 12:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
