(7321483, 1142677, 173844, '<td valign="top">Amazing image, a work of art.  Terrific title.  I hope this gets the respect and admiration it deserves... but if not, so what.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Amazing image, a work of art.  Terrific title.  I hope this gets the respect and admiration it deserves... but if not, so what.  One of my favorites.', '2015-02-27 12:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
