(7321689, 1142588, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this... until I get to the man.   I think he either needs to not be there at all... or he needs to be more of the scene.   Cutting him off at the chin... makes him seem like an accident, I fear.<br/> <br/>I do love the top.  Gorgeous!</td>', 'I love this... until I get to the man.   I think he either needs to not be there at all... or he needs to be more of the scene.   Cutting him off at the chin... makes him seem like an accident, I fear. I do love the top.  Gorgeous!', '2015-02-27 20:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
