(7321774, 1142521, 163430, '<td valign="top">That''s more of a yellow than orange in my book.</td>', 'That''s more of a yellow than orange in my book.', '2015-02-28 08:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321775, 1142356, 163430, '<td valign="top">Interesting one. I like how the white of the snow and the orange of the orange complement each other. It''s not the most photogenic sample of the orange fruit family, though. The harsh shadows could have been avoided if you shot the scene from the other side.</td>', 'Interesting one. I like how the white of the snow and the orange of the orange complement each other. It''s not the most photogenic sample of the orange fruit family, though. The harsh shadows could have been avoided if you shot the scene from the other side.', '2015-02-28 08:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321776, 1142499, 163430, '<td valign="top">Made me laugh.<br/>The humor aside, it''s an excellent photo with top notch lighting. Excellent contrast and colors. I would have cropped a bit from the camera left side, behind the subject.</td>', 'Made me laugh.The humor aside, it''s an excellent photo with top notch lighting. Excellent contrast and colors. I would have cropped a bit from the camera left side, behind the subject.', '2015-02-28 08:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321777, 1142641, 163430, '<td valign="top">Good one. <br/>Darker blacks and some more structure (microcontrast) would have added to the image. Having said that, the border doesn''t add a thing.</td>', 'Good one. Darker blacks and some more structure (microcontrast) would have added to the image. Having said that, the border doesn''t add a thing.', '2015-02-28 08:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321778, 1142264, 163430, '<td valign="top">The orange (both as the fruit and the colour) does not have the impact factor that i expect in an orange themed challenge. The fruit is lost between the leaves, the shadows and the ground. It just doesn''t stand out in any way.</td>', 'The orange (both as the fruit and the colour) does not have the impact factor that i expect in an orange themed challenge. The fruit is lost between the leaves, the shadows and the ground. It just doesn''t stand out in any way.', '2015-02-28 08:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321779, 1142619, 163430, '<td valign="top">Good one.<br/>Maybe a tad overexposed. It''s not about the plate blending in the background, i like that. The herbs and the fruit look burned a bit.</td>', 'Good one.Maybe a tad overexposed. It''s not about the plate blending in the background, i like that. The herbs and the fruit look burned a bit.', '2015-02-28 08:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321783, 1142599, 163430, '<td valign="top">I like:<br/>- The way the orange bag stands out<br/>- The captured motion of the protagonists as they battle the show storm and the motion of the snow itself. <br/> <br/>I don''t like:<br/>- That the main protagonist (the lady with the orange bag) got her feet cut off<br/> <br/>Some selective desaturation (not necessarily full desaturation) on the non-orange elements might emphasize the bag even more.</td>', 'I like:- The way the orange bag stands out- The captured motion of the protagonists as they battle the show storm and the motion of the snow itself.  I don''t like:- That the main protagonist (the lady with the orange bag) got her feet cut off Some selective desaturation (not necessarily full desaturation) on the non-orange elements might emphasize the bag even more.', '2015-02-28 08:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321784, 1142492, 163430, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and composition, but a bit "overcooked" for my taste.</td>', 'Nice colours and composition, but a bit "overcooked" for my taste.', '2015-02-28 08:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321788, 1142647, 163430, '<td valign="top">WOW! Her eyes. Soul piercing. The composition goes well with the shallow DoF. They are so strong that they make me look away from the orange cap. <br/> <br/>I would bet on this to be a sure winner if only there was something orange to balance those strong eyes. Orange lipstick, orange nail polish (on that only visible pinky) and earrings, orange anorak...<br/> <br/>You should have saved it for the free study.</td>', 'WOW! Her eyes. Soul piercing. The composition goes well with the shallow DoF. They are so strong that they make me look away from the orange cap.  I would bet on this to be a sure winner if only there was something orange to balance those strong eyes. Orange lipstick, orange nail polish (on that only visible pinky) and earrings, orange anorak... You should have saved it for the free study.', '2015-02-28 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7321789, 1142602, 163430, '<td valign="top">This image begs for more orange. It''s got potential, but looks more suited for a blue challenge than an orange one. There must be more orange in this image that can be extracted in post.</td>', 'This image begs for more orange. It''s got potential, but looks more suited for a blue challenge than an orange one. There must be more orange in this image that can be extracted in post.', '2015-02-28 08:48:52.000000', NULL, 1);
