(7322645, 1142389, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  We visited Mesa Arch a few years back, when my daughter was around 7.  We were lucky enough to have the whole arch to ourselves for about 15 minutes, and then a throng of people showed up.  My daughter was taking pictures when someone realized they were standing in the way, and they apologized to her for being in her shot.  Without hesitation, she said, "Don''t worry... I''ll just Photoshop you out!" :)</td>', 'Great shot!  We visited Mesa Arch a few years back, when my daughter was around 7.  We were lucky enough to have the whole arch to ourselves for about 15 minutes, and then a throng of people showed up.  My daughter was taking pictures when someone realized they were standing in the way, and they apologized to her for being in her shot.  Without hesitation, she said, "Don''t worry... I''ll just Photoshop you out!" :)', '2015-03-02 13:08:25.000000', NULL, 0),
